kf_exprsecs,refl_htrgen,relvort,/
ta050,ta100,ta150,ta200,ta350,ta400,ta450,ta550,ta600,ta650,ta750,ta800,ta900,ta950,ta1000,/
td050,td100,td150,td200,td250,td300,td350,td400,td450,td500,td550,td600,td650,td700,td750,td800,td850,td900,td950,td1000,/
rh050,rh100,rh150,rh200,rh350,rh400,rh450,rh550,rh600,rh650,rh750,rh800,rh900,rh950,rh1000,/
